BaseVault_initialize
  ├── ParentVault
  │   ├── when initialization succeeds
  │   │   ├── it should set mutable base vault state
  │   │   └── it should grant base vault roles
  │   ├── when default admin is the zero address
  │   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  │   ├── when pauser is the zero address
  │   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  │   ├── when unpauser is the zero address
  │   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  │   ├── when config operator is the zero address
  │   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  │   ├── when emergency receiver is the zero address
  │   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  │   ├── when upgrader is the zero address
  │   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  │   ├── when initial default CCIP gas limit is zero
  │   │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAmount
  │   ├── when the proxy is already initialized
  │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
  │   └── when called on the implementation
  │       └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
  └── ChildVault
      ├── when initialization succeeds
      │   ├── it should set mutable base vault state
      │   └── it should grant base vault roles
      ├── when default admin is the zero address
      │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
      ├── when pauser is the zero address
      │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
      ├── when unpauser is the zero address
      │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
      ├── when config operator is the zero address
      │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
      ├── when emergency receiver is the zero address
      │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
      ├── when upgrader is the zero address
      │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
      ├── when initial default CCIP gas limit is zero
      │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAmount
      ├── when the proxy is already initialized
      │   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
      └── when called on the implementation
          └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
